# Local Python 3.12 UEFI package output (create_python_pkg.bat).
# Globbed rather than enumerated: the previous explicit list let ad-hoc staging
# trees such as myUEFIPy312_0908/ and myUEFIPy312_latest/ stay untracked-but-
# visible, which is how an earlier `git add -A` swept 278 generated files into a
# commit. Anything matching this prefix is build output, never source.
/myUEFIPy312*/
/myUEFIPy/
